OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 4 APR
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. You can contact
OL,7,     Gthe show by emailing
OL,8,     G3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,9,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,10,     GTom Service introduces the
OL,11,     Gperfect classical soundtrack for
OL,12,     Gthe weekend, and meets acclaimed
OL,13,     GFrench conductor Raphael Pichon.
OL,14,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,15,     GJools is joined by poet Padraig O
OL,16,     GTuama with music by Sibelius,
OL,17,     GRichter and Kapsberger.
OL,18,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,19,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,20,     GThe year is 1026. Monk Guido
OL,21,     Gd'Arezzo causes a musical
OL,22,     Grevolution with a new invention.
